{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — FAQ Accordion Section
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div class="zvhc-section-header">
      <div class="zvhc-eyebrow">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-heading-md">Everything You Need To Know</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-muted); margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
        Have questions about our sourcing, formula, or our 30-day satisfaction guarantee? We have answers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zvhc-faq-list">
      <!-- FAQ 1 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item is-open">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">How soon can I expect to notice healthier scalp and hair?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          Most customers notice significantly softer, shinier strands and a calmer, deeply moisturized scalp within the first 1 to 2 weeks of regular application. With consistent massage and routine use over 4 to 8 weeks, hair strands feel noticeably stronger with visibly reduced breakage.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 2 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">What makes Cold-Pressed Batana Oil so effective?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          Unlike mineral oils or synthetic silicones that merely coat the hair shaft, pure Batana oil contains rich phytosterols, carotenoids, and essential fatty acids (oleic and linoleic acids). These plant lipids deeply condition the scalp moisture barrier and nourish dry hair cuticles from root to tip.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 3 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">Will this oil weigh down fine or straight hair?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          Not when used properly! While Batana is deeply conditioning, it absorbs readily into the scalp. If you have fine or straight hair, simply use 2–3 drops as a pre-wash treatment 30 minutes before shampooing, or massage into your scalp overnight and wash out in the morning.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 4 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">Is it safe for color-treated, bleached, or relaxed hair?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          Yes, absolutely. Chemical processing, bleaching, and thermal heat styling deplete hair of its protective lipid layer. Batana oil replenishes essential lipid nourishment, smoothing the cuticle to help retain moisture and protect against everyday stress.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ 5 -->
      <div class="zvhc-faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="zvhc-faq-trigger">
          <span class="zvhc-faq-q">How does your 30-Day Satisfaction Guarantee work?</span>
          <span class="zvhc-faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="zvhc-faq-answer">
          We want you to experience Zavelyn Hair Care with complete peace of mind. If you are not completely satisfied with your hair care experience within 30 days of receiving your order, simply email our customer support at support@tryzavelyn.com for assistance with a return or refund.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC PDP FAQ",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
